        "text": "def solve(rows):\n  \"\"\"Calculates the total cost of rows based on specified rules.\"\"\"\n  audit_positions = [(i) for i in range(len(rows)) if i % 4 != 2 or i == len(rows) - 1] \n  transformed_rows = []\n  for i in audit_positions:\n    transformed_rows.append(rows[i])\n\n  if not transformed_rows:\n    return 0\n\n  rotated_rows = transformed_rows[1:] + [transformed_rows[0]]\n\n  total_cost = 0\n  for row in rotated_rows:\n    if row >= 0:\n      if row <= 16:\n        cost = row * 4\n      else:\n        cost = 16 * 4 + (row - 16) * 3\n      \n      if cost <= 77:\n        total_cost += cost\n      else:\n        total_cost += 77\n\n  return total_cost",
